{"about":["System Shock® 2: 25th Anniversary Remaster by Nightdive Studios brings to you the modernized remaster of the FPS/RPG classic, featuring Cross-Play Co-Op multiplayer and more.","It’s the year 2114 and as you awake from cryo sleep on the FTL ship Von Braun, you are unable to remember who or where you are… and something has gone terribly wrong. Hybrid mutants and deadly robots roam the halls while the cries from the remaining crew reverberate through the cold hull of the ship. SHODAN, a rogue AI bent on the destruction of mankind has taken over and it's up to you to stop her.","Delve through the corridors of the derelict ship Von Braun and immerse yourself in the story rich atmosphere and environments. Explore deck by deck and unravel the horrifying fate of the Von Braun and her crew.","System Shock® 2: 25th Anniversary Remaster Key Features:","• Cross-Play Co-Op multiplayer.","• Choose from 3 branches of the Military; O.S.A, Marines or Navy and experiment with different play styles.","• Up to 120 FPS performance with ultra-widescreen support.","• 50 Trophies to unlock.","• Enhanced Characters, Weapon Models and Animations.","• Optimized Controller support.","• Quality of Life Improvements.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function"],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/2118/cda151be5730b51b6faefb0ec1bfd690d30362a7b24c35a5.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/2118/cda151be5730b51b6faefb0ec1bfd690d30362a7b24c35a5.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/2118/711a1c7b466efc9e708ae248c9efe942dfa57b91c2b21ab3.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/2118/711a1c7b466efc9e708ae248c9efe942dfa57b91c2b21ab3.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202502/2118/663873156379bc123dacf7f9938eedf3d339027be73b5cf4.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api